  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "7feeee2f-3625-4e2b-be98-49a0c12dbe30",
    "name": "LatticeSchola",
    "description": "## LatticeSchola API\n\nLatticeSchola is a RESTful API for managing an educational platform. It provides endpoints to handle the core entities of a learning system — **Students**, **Courses**, and the **Relationships** between them.\n\n### Resources\n\n**Students**\nManage the full lifecycle of student records:\n- Create a new student\n- Retrieve all students or a specific student by ID\n- Update a student's details\n- Delete a student\n\n**Courses**\nManage course catalog operations:\n- Create a new course\n- Retrieve all courses or a specific course by ID\n- Update course details\n- Delete a course\n\n**Relationships**\nHandle student–course associations:\n- Assign a course to a student\n- Retrieve all courses enrolled by a specific student\n\n### Base URL\n`http://localhost:3000/api`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "49826122",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/49826122-7feeee2f-3625-4e2b-be98-49a0c12dbe30?source=collection_link"
  },
